# `src/app` and middleware

- **Route groups:** Folders `(name)` do not appear in URLs. Match **sibling** routes when adding pages so `PublicGuard` / `ProtectedGuard` and chrome (sidebar vs console) stay consistent.
- **Middleware:** Do not break Apple SSO handling on `POST /login` (must stay **302** redirect to GET with `code` and `state`). See `src/middleware.ts` comments.
- **Root layout:** `internalRoutes` in `src/app/layout.tsx` server-redirects specific paths to `/login` before segment layouts—do not add `(internal)` pages without checking that list.
- **Thin pages:** Keep `page.tsx` small; import feature components from `@blocks-idp`, `@blocks-*`, or `@/modules/...`.
- **New `@blocks-idp` route:** After adding `page.tsx`, run `npm run idp:route-map` and commit updated `.cursor/docs/idp/route-map.md` when appropriate.
- **Specs:** `.cursor/docs/app/README.md` and `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-10-src-app-shell-design.md`.
